OL,3,GNEWSAKinship pilot helping 450
OL,4,Achildren, council says
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 450 children are benefiting
OL,7,Ffrom financial support through a
OL,8,Fkinship trial, North East Lincolnshire
OL,9,FCouncil has said.
OL,11,FKinship care involves children being
OL,12,Flooked after by relatives or friends to
OL,13,Fkeep them out of the care system.
OL,15,FKerry, who cares for two grandchildren,
OL,16,Fsaid: "It's been tricky to say the
OL,17,Fleast, I've had to give up work. You
OL,18,Fhave to navigate all the things you
OL,19,Fthought you'd left behind."
