OL,3,GNEWSAKinship pilot helping 450
OL,4,Achildren, council says
OL,5,
OL,6,FJosh MacAlister, minister for children
OL,7,Fand families, met carers in Cleethorpes
OL,8,Ffor National Kinship Carers Week. He
OL,9,Fsaid: "Kinship carers step up every day
OL,10,Fso that children can grow up in loving
OL,11,Ffamily homes with networks of people
OL,12,Fthey know. That's why we are giving
OL,13,Fthem this support."
